cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Cite the upstream Docker documentation and the associated paper separately."
type: dataset
title: "DockerDocsSet2026: Docker documentation variants, question sets and support judgments"
abstract: >-
  Docker documentation from docker/docs at commit 274681c49355bd951ae60c9208e854ff70f12474,
  two experimental refinements of it (LT, leaf-and-trunk; R0, uninformed), the retrieval
  corpora and link graphs derived from each version, 144 FAQ questions with reference answers,
  15 complex tasks with 73 core requirements, and LLM-verified page-support judgments for each
  documentation version. Used for the Docker application in the ICSC 2027 submission
  "Measuring Directed Documentation Structure with Normalized Magnetic Spectra".
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
